-- Clean up DB script bindings that name a script no core has (PLAN.md P1 cleanup).
-- Each row's script exists neither in SkyFire's core (incl. the open port branches) nor in Legends of Azeroth
-- Pandaria 5.4.8 or Torghast, so the binding only produced a 'script not found' error at startup. Bindings to
-- scripts LoA has are kept as porting leads. The full list is skyfire_port_plan/data/dangling_scriptnames_cleared.tsv.
-- Every statement checks the old name, so it is safe to run twice and never touches a binding fixed since.

-- creature_template
